   "landmarks": [
    "article",
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 283,
   "text": "When I started thinking about structuring CSS, I was intimidated at first: I’m\nnot very good at structuring my CSS! But then I started reading blog posts\ntalking about how to structure CSS (like A whole cascade of layers or How I write CSS in 2024)\nand I realized a couple of things:",
   "counts": {
    "links": 2,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 1,
