    "height": 80,
    "widthFraction": 0.4,
    "leftFraction": 0.3,
    "pageFraction": 0.08,
    "aboveFold": true
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 7,
   "tag": "ol",
   "landmarks": [
    "article",
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 340,
   "text": "Every CSS code base has a bunch of different things going on (layouts! fonts! colours! common components!)\nIt’s extremely useful to have systems or guidelines to manage each of those things, otherwise things descend into chaos\nTailwind has systems for some of these, and I already know those systems! Maybe I can imitate the systems I like!",
   "counts": {
