  {
   "index": 17,
   "tag": "ol",
   "landmarks": [
    "article",
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 173,
   "text": "Basically the idea is that:\nEach “component” has a unique class\nThe CSS for one component never overrides the CSS for any other component\nEach component has its own CSS file",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 3,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 1,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
