    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 18,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "article",
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 317,
   "text": "So editing the CSS for one component won’t mysteriously break something in\nanother component. And probably like 80% of the CSS that I would actually want\nto change is in various component files, so if I’m editing a 100-line component,\nI just have to think about those 100 lines. It’s way easier for me to think\nabout.",
